From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:59:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Publish per-window tab counts for taskbar applets

Write $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/cosmic-term-tabs/<pid>.json with the window
title and tab count whenever update_title sets the window title. The
file is rewritten atomically and only when its content changes, and is
removed when the app exits.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

